# Claude Code per-project workspace.  Personal state (settings.local.json,
# scheduled-task locks, transcripts) that should never travel with the repo.
.claude/

# Service-account keys + credentials.  Any *.json that's actually a
# Google / AWS / Azure key, or anything labelled "credentials", must
# never be committed.  Keys belong in Secret Manager / GitHub Secrets,
# not in source.
*-key*.json
*credentials*.json
service-account*.json
*.pem
*.p12

# Local design / UX preview output (logo iteration, mockup screenshots,
# scratch HTML).  Useful while iterating; not source of truth.
.preview/
